      <p><seg source="#source-555-558">愈</seg><g ref="#gaiji-1-2-22" source="#source-558-591">〻</g><seg source="#source-591-612">御安全之由、奉</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-612-624">レ</note><seg source="#source-624-663">賀入候。然バ銭之議御申越被</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-663-675">レ</note><seg source="#source-675-789">下候得共、此節一向ニ銭切ニ而困入申候。此間之中ニ田舎より登候ハバ、其節差上可</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-789-801">レ</note><seg source="#source-801-812">申候。</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-812-847" style="padding-inline-start: 2em">
        <p><seg source="#source-833-847">（不明）</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-847-879" style="padding-inline-end: 0em; text-align: right">
        <p><seg source="#source-865-879">坂本龍馬</seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p style="text-indent: 1em" rend="first-line-indent(1)"><seg source="#source-879-899">五月廿五日</seg></p>
        <p><seg source="#source-899-929">清井権二郎殿（不明）</seg></p>
      </div>
    </body>
